The wobbly spring-mass model in src/WobblyModel.{hpp,cpp} is a C++ port of
the JavaScript implementation in https://github.com/hermes83/compiz-windows-effect
by Mauro Pepe, which is itself derived from the original Compiz wobbly plugin
by David Reveman and Scott Moreau (Novell, Inc., 2005). The spring model was
implemented by Kristian Hogsberg. The original code is distributed under a
permissive license; see file headers for full notices.

